      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Giraffe Centre in Rongai was founded in 1979 by Jock and Betty Leslie Melville after rescuing orphaned giraffes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://touristplaces.guide/top-10-places-to-visit-in-ongata-rongai-nature-adventure-and-history/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Rongai’s proximity to Nairobi National Park has sparked increasing human‑wildlife conflict, especially with lions.",
